{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0199-s002", "text": "Du kan inte heller ansöka om privatvårdsstöd för den kommunala småbarnspedagogiken.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013734454458+0000-5/hb-c08-u0199-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.453605442176871, "peak": 0.249176025390625, "generation_seconds": 14.807019509840757, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0200-s001", "text": "Stödets storlek beror bland annat på familjens inkomster och kommunen som familjen bor i.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013734454458+0000-5/hb-c08-u0200-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.801904761904762, "peak": 0.2994384765625, "generation_seconds": 15.11779754399322, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0201-s001", "text": "FPA betalar stödet direkt till skötaren eller producenten av småbarnspedagogik.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013734454458+0000-5/hb-c08-u0201-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.274261474609375, "generation_seconds": 15.844546860083938, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0201-s002", "text": "Man måste betala skatt för privatvårdsstödet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013734454458+0000-5/hb-c08-u0201-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.458231292517007, "peak": 0.3216552734375, "generation_seconds": 9.069609224097803, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0201-s003", "text": "Stödet betalas inte till utlandet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013734454458+0000-5/hb-c08-u0201-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4829931972789114, "peak": 0.304840087890625, "generation_seconds": 8.135107479989529, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0026-s001", "text": "Till småbarnspedagogiken hör mångsidig verksamhet, till exempel lekar, motion, utevistelse, musik, pyssel och utfärder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013734454458+0000-5/hb-c08-u0026-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.518639455782314, "peak": 0.292572021484375, "generation_seconds": 21.822527365991846, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0026-s002", "text": "I dagen ingår också en vilostund.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013734454458+0000-5/hb-c08-u0026-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.2043537414965986, "peak": 0.324615478515625, "generation_seconds": 7.380174650112167, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0026-s003", "text": "Målsättningen med verksamheten är att främja barnets utveckling och lärande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013734454458+0000-5/hb-c08-u0026-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.313629150390625, "generation_seconds": 13.493300881003961, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
